driver by David Joseph and contributors:

    https://github.com/davidjo/snd_hda_macbookpro

    Copyright (C) David Joseph
    Licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 2.

The files under src/apple/ and src/patches/ are derived from that project
and retain their original copyright and licence. The Apple HDA verb/I2C
initialisation tables were reverse-engineered from macOS AppleHDA.kext
traces by the snd_hda_macbookpro authors.

New in this package: the 6.17+ sound/hda build integration, kernel 7.0
verification, installer, DKMS packaging, diagnostics, verification tooling
and documentation. These are released under GPL-2.0 as well.

